{"step_index":49,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-17T04:21:52Z","model":"gpt-oss-120b-medium","input_tokens":31262,"cache_read_tokens":3839,"output_tokens":752,"thinking":"We need create additional pages: checkout.html, orders.html, profile.html, and JS files (dashboard.js, checkout.js, orders.js, profile.js). Also need to ensure existing cart works.\n\nImplement simple functions.\n\nWill create checkout.html referencing checkout.js; orders.html referencing orders.js; profile.html referencing profile.js.\n\nImplement JS using storage API.\n\nAlso need order processing functionality: checkout page will read cart, display items, allow address and payment method, on submit generate order object, update storage, reduce stock, clear cart, show confirmation (maybe via alert or show a message within page). After placing order, redirect to orders.html.\n\nImplement order storage: storage API already has orders array.\n\nDefine order schema.\n\nImplement in checkout.js.\n\nNow create files.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"\"<!DOCTYPE html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <title>Checkout - Simple E‑Commerce</title>\\n    <link rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" href=\\\"../assets/css/style.css\\\" />\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n    <header>\\n        <nav id=\\\"navbar\\\"></nav>\\n    </header>\\n    <main class=\\\"container\\\" id=\\\"checkoutPage\\\">\\n        <h1>Checkout</h1>\\n        <div id=\\\"orderSummary\\\"></div>\\n        <h2>Delivery Information</h2>\\n        <form id=\\\"checkoutForm\\\">\\n            <label for=\\\"fullName\\\">Full Name:</label><br />\\n            <input type=\\\"text\\\" id=\\\"fullName\\\" required /><br />\\n            <label for=\\\"address\\\">Address:</label><br />\\n            <textarea id=\\\"address\\\" rows=\\\"3\\\" required></textarea><br />\\n            <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone:</label><br />\\n            <input type=\\\"tel\\\" id=\\\"phone\\\" required /><br />\\n            <h2>Payment Method</h2>\\n            <select id=\\\"paymentMethod\\\" required>\\n                <option value=\\\"UPI\\\">UPI (demo)</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"Card\\\">Card (demo)</option>\\n                <option value=\\\"COD\\\">Cash on Delivery</option>\\n            </select><br /><br />\\n            <button type=\\\"submit\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">Place Order</button>\\n        </form>\\n        <div id=\\\"confirmationMessage\\\" style=\\\"display:none; margin-top:1rem;\\\">\\n            <h2>Order Placed!</h2>\\n            <p id=\\\"orderIdDisplay\\\"></p>\\n            <a href=\\\"orders.html\\\" class=\\\"btn\\\">View My Orders</a>\\n        </div>\\n    </main>\\n    <footer class=\\\"footer\\\"><p>&copy; 2026 Simple E‑Commerce</p></footer>\\n    <script src=\\\"../assets/js/storage.js\\\"></script>\\n    <script src=\\\"../assets/js/auth.js\\\"></script>\\n    <script src=\\\"../assets/js/main.js\\\"></script>\\n    <script src=\\\"checkout.js\\\"></script>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\MY-PC\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\68b1e791-e5ed-4ad6-9fc6-05d27d9c0cc7\\\\customer\\\\checkout.html\""}}]}
